{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01CAQEAHpPR9xZteKmoXvNbp","type":"tool_result","content":"=== Mutation testing the differential suite ===\n  caught: c2Add operand order (NaN payload)\n  caught: c2Dot add operand order (NaN payload)\n  caught: c2Div: true division instead of reciprocal-multiply\n  caught: c_abs -> f32::abs (breaks -0.0 and NaN sign)\n  caught: c_min -> f32::min (breaks NaN asymmetry)\n  caught: c_max -> f32::max (breaks NaN asymmetry)\n  caught: c2CastRay accepts an out-of-range enum value\n  caught: c2RaytoPoly: hi < lo becomes hi <= lo\n  caught: c2RaytoPoly: index sentinel ~0 -> 0\n  caught: c2RaytoPoly: clamp count to 8 (a 'safety fix' the C does not do)\n  caught: c2RaytoPoly: reject NULL bx instead of using identity\n  caught: c2RaytoCircle: t <= A.t becomes t < A.t\n  caught: c2RaytoCircle: disc < 0 becomes disc <= 0\n  !!!! NOT CAUGHT: c2RaytoAABB: out->t operand order (NaN payload)  <-- the suite has a blind spot\n  caught: c2RaytoAABB: swap the (0,-1) and (0,1) normals\n  caught: c2RaytoCapsule: drop the pre-write of *out\n  !!!! NOT CAUGHT: c2RaytoCapsule: y computation operand order (NaN payload)  <-- the suite has a blind spot\n  caught: c2RaytoCapsule: c > 0 becomes c >= 0\n  caught: c2CircleToPoint: strict < becomes <=\n  caught: c2AABBtoPoint: one axis uses >= instead of >\n  caught: c2Skew: forget the negation\n  caught: c2MulrvT: -a.s*b.x parsed as -(a.s*b.x) ... plus a sign slip\n  !!!! NOT CAUGHT: sqrtss: use f32::NAN instead of the x86 indefinite QNaN  <-- the suite has a blind spot\n  !!!! NOT CAUGHT: poly_ray: swap the two ray directions  <-- the suite has a blind spot\n  caught: quiet(): do not quiet signalling NaNs\n\n=== Confirming the restored source still passes ===\n  restored source: PASS\n\n############ BLIND SPOTS FOUND ############","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d7f5ddbc-08b7-475f-b88b-e2f573c46cbe","uuid":"d9421d68-9fa3-4209-95ba-d428f58f34fe